ns and equipment, including artillery pieces, tanks, and machine guns. This battle was a big win for the Finnish forces and lifted the morale of the entire Finnish Army. After this successful counter-attack, there were no major battles in this area, and only infrequent gunfire occurred. The Finnish troops held their position there until the end of the Winter War."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":true,"cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WinterWar","isReserved":true,"spawnCardName":"card_unit_sissi","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundCue'War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_5_Cue'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/War_UI/Cues/Drum_Movements/War_UI_Drum_Movement_Field_Snares_5_Cue.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Finland/t_order_or_inf_fin.t_order_or_inf_fin","SubPathString":""},"artist":"Finnish WW2 poster","historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/COLD_TRAP.COLD_TRAP","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":317.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_event_strike_from_the_forest_photo","SourceString":"Finnish soldiers during the Battle of Tolvajärvi, December 1939.","LocalizedString":"Finnish soldiers during the Battle of Tolvajärvi, December 1939."},"OnAttackVisualsSoft":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Blueprints/Effects/BP_AttackOrder.BP_AttackOrder_C","SubPathString":""},"isDirectDamage":true},"variables":[],"functions":[{"name":"CanPlayFromHand","owner":"card_event_strike_from_the_forest_C","params":[{"name":"canIt","type":"bool","direction":"out"},{"name":"reason","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"reasonParam1","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"reasonParam2","type":"FString","direction":"out"},{"name":"targetedCard","type":"UBaseCardObject*","direction":"out"}],"pure":false,"event":true,"flags":"FUNC_Event | FUNC_Public | FUNC_HasOutParms | FUNC_BlueprintCallable | FUNC_BlueprintEvent","locals":[{"name":"CallFunc_GetTargetedCard_hasTarge